      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Test path (v3)\nManual Trigger -> Test Candidates (5 fake candidates) -> Run Candidate Through Flow (runs THIS workflow once per candidate) -> When Executed by Another Workflow -> Config -> the unchanged flow.\nSave the workflow before testing: the sub-run uses the saved version. Each candidate is a separate sub-execution in the Executions list.\n\n**Expected results**\n1. Test Candidate One: QUALIFIED - 5 y, 4 skill categories (Backend, Frontend, Data, Cloud/DevOps)\n2. Test Candidate Two: NOT qualified - 1 y (`Experience 1 y < 3 y`)\n3. Test Candidate Three: NOT qualified - Java stack, 0 categories (`Skill categories 0 < 2`)\n4. Test Candidate Four: QUALIFIED - experience only as date ranges, about 6-7 y; 3 categories (Backend, Cloud/DevOps, Data)\n5. Test Candidate Five: NOT qualified - no data (`Experience 0 y < 3 y; Skill categories 0 < 2`)\n\nGoogle Sheet: only candidates 1 and 4 are appended (delete these rows after the test). Scores come from the LLM; totalScore and tier are calculated.",
